# Normalize all text files to LF on checkin/checkout, regardless of the
# checking-out machine's core.autocrlf — this repo had no .gitattributes
# before, so CRLF line endings committed from Windows checkouts were landing
# in the repository itself (not just a local working-tree artifact), which is
# why `bun run lint` (prettier, LF by default) failed in CI on every commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
